  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 29 April 2003 the proposed roof extension at 69 Helen Avenue Middlesex TW14 9LA would not be lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe development does not fall within Class B Part 1 Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 because the cubic content of the resulting building and all relevant ancillary structures would exceed the maximum permitted development volume of 70 cubic metres, for development to a semi detached dwelling.\r\n\r\nA planning application is therefore required.\r\n"
